ferrite (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Structured error codes (25 numeric codes across 5 categories)
  * 8 new command families: AUTOINDEX, CONV, COST, MULTICLOUD, POLICY, S3,
    SLOT, VECTOR.INGEST
  * Handler state persistence (all 47 handlers persist/restore via Store)
  * Full SDK generator for 8 languages with FFI layer
  * OpenTelemetry integration (traces, metrics, OTLP export)
  * Predictive auto-scaling and cost optimization
  * Enhanced cluster redirect with slot routing tests
  * Migration tooling: RDB import, zero-downtime orchestrator

 -- Ferrite Maintainers <maintainers@ferrite.dev>  Sat, 15 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000

ferrite (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Full-text search with BM25 scoring
  * Semantic caching for LLM responses
  * Embedded mode for edge/IoT deployments
  * FerritQL query language
  * WASM user-defined functions
  * CDC and event streaming pipelines
  * Multi-tenancy and tenant isolation
  * Prometheus metrics and Grafana dashboards
  * Kubernetes sidecar injection webhook

 -- Ferrite Maintainers <maintainers@ferrite.dev>  Sat, 01 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000

ferrite (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Redis-compatible key-value store with tiered storage
  * Support for strings, lists, sets, sorted sets, hashes
  * Vector search and embeddings support
  * Time-series data capabilities
  * Graph database features
  * CRDT support for distributed systems
  * AOF and checkpoint persistence
  * Cluster and replication support
  * TLS/mTLS encryption
  * ACL authentication

 -- Ferrite Maintainers <maintainers@ferrite.dev>  Sat, 01 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000
